/*
 * $DOC$
 * $NAME$
 * wg_Label
 *
 * $ONELINER$
 * Display text in a WebGUI container
 *
 * $SYNTAX$
 * wg_Label():New( oParent, [cText] ) --> oLabel
 *
 * $ARGUMENTS$
 * `oParent` Window or layout container.
 * `cText` Initial text. Omit it to start with an empty label.
 *
 * $RETURNS$
 * The label object.
 *
 * $DESCRIPTION$
 * Assign `oLabel:text` to update the displayed text, for example from the `onClick` block of a button.
 *
 * $CATEGORY$
 * User libraries WebGUI
 *
 * $SEEALSO$
 * wg_Control, wg_Button, wg_Row
 *
 * $DOCEND$
 */
